TZVP-MOLOPT-UZH-PBE0-GTH-q19
============================

GTH valence orbital basis. Use matching PBE0 GTH-q19 potentials.
No GTH pseudopotential is included in this BSE entry.

Native CP2K aliases: TZVP-MOLOPT-PBE0-GTH-q19, TZVP-MOLOPT-HYB-GTH-q19.
Published UZH protocol source: mirhosseini2026a.
See the molopt_uzh family notes for provenance and q-value matching.
